  "uses_raw": true,
  "prompt": "Using category_raw alone, how many products belong to each parent category, and how many of them name the parent itself? These tables may hold errors. A category_raw value names a child category when it equals that category's category_name, ignoring letter case and spaces at the start or end, and the child's parent_category is then its parent. It names the parent TV & Video itself when it is 'tv & video', 'tv en video', 'tv/video' or 'téléviseurs', ignoring letter case and outer spaces. Return three columns, in this order: parent_category, n_products and n_parent_spelling. Return one row for each parent category with at least one product. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "parent_category",
        "type_class": "text"
      },
      {
        "name": "n_products",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
